WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:02.961
People of Trivantes

00:00:02.961 --> 00:00:04.630
sight will return.

00:00:05.756 --> 00:00:06.924
Having people be blown away

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:09.009
when they see what season two
looks like.

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:13.388
We are chosen to usher
 in a new world.

00:00:14.306 --> 00:00:15.599
The level of ambition on this

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.892
show was through the roof.

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:19.519
If I do not return,
then I am dead.

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:27.527
Season two picks up about
thirty days after

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.654
season one has ended.

00:00:28.779 --> 00:00:31.907
And we rejoin Baba Voss
on his way to Trivantes

00:00:31.907 --> 00:00:32.908
to rescue his daughter.

00:00:33.492 --> 00:00:35.494
Bab's going to face his past

00:00:35.535 --> 00:00:37.454
and everything that he ran
from and everything that

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:38.205
kind of made him.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.415
The mighty Baba Voss,

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:42.209
greetings brother.

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:45.420
It's such a dark history,

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.673
Baba killed their father
and disappeared.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.424
Edo hated him for many years

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:50.884
because of their shared history,

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:54.221
and when gets wind of Baba Voss
being around again

00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:56.682
he's gonna do everything in his
power to destroy his brother.

00:00:56.765 --> 00:00:58.058
Advance!

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.937
There's danger,
peculiarities pop up.

00:01:03.522 --> 00:01:08.068
As the season continues we see
tension build between everyone.

00:01:08.527 --> 00:01:10.237
The cracks that were
already starting to show

00:01:10.237 --> 00:01:11.947
throughout season one
just start widening.

00:01:13.198 --> 00:01:15.826
I think you failed to
realize just how close

00:01:15.826 --> 00:01:16.910
to the edge we are.

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.706
We're gonna go into this
world that we've

00:01:20.706 --> 00:01:22.916
never got to experience
in season one.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:25.127
It's like he's crawling back
into hell.

00:01:29.715 --> 00:01:33.969
This season is the best
season I've ever had.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:38.724
Most men choose to avoid my
father at any cost.

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:42.227
Now, the general is not
like most men.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.230
And he's been waiting
a very long time to get

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:48.275
his hands on Baba Voss.
♪♪

00:01:49.318 --> 00:01:50.944
[screams]

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.990
Welcome home Baba.

00:01:55.991 --> 00:01:56.992
♪♪

